1830
02:17:20.474 --> 02:17:22.442
<i>Yeah,</i>
<i>it's a piece of shit.</i>

1831
02:17:27.749 --> 02:17:30.551
Okay, Irv.
I'll see you on set.

1832
02:17:34.622 --> 02:17:35.957
Mr. Conrad?

1833
02:17:43.097 --> 02:17:47.168
Harold, how you doing?
I'm doing good, Jack.
