Cut! Fantastic!

1844
02:18:16.463 --> 02:18:18.465
Not a dry eye in the house.

1845
02:18:18.599 --> 02:18:20.568
Great. For this next take...
Yeah.

1846
02:18:20.701 --> 02:18:23.604
